      "content": "it just feels so lonely. like i'm stuck in this weird limbo where i'm still breathing but i'm not really \"alive\" anymore. everything we built, everything that was \"us\"... it's all just gone. sometimes i just sit here thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just stop this feeling. if i didn't have to wake up to this emptiness every single day. it's just such a heavy, dark hole.",
